{"id": "EUVD-2026-102488", "enisaUuid": "b53e1f6e-e3a6-3f45-a504-309ad4e69235", "description": "APITable through 1.14.0-beta contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows authenticated users to read node descriptions from other spaces by supplying a user-controlled nodeId. Attackers can request GET /node/{nodeId}/description, which skips space membership and node permission checks, to disclose cross-tenant datasheet, folder, and form descriptions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T14:28:05", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/apitable-node-description-cross-space-idor", "https://github.com/apitable/apitable/blob/v1.14.0-beta/backend-server/application/src/main/java/com/apitable/workspace/controller/NodeController.java#L1043-L1057", "https://github.com/apitable/apitable", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/apitable-through-1.14.0-beta-authorization-bypass-via-get-node-nodeid-description"], "aliases": ["GHSA-566j-v842-c9mx", "CVE-2026-111344"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a1482294-def9-39c7-8755-536be58ca14e", "product": {"name": "apitable", "vendor": {"name": "apitable"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.14.0-beta"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "20690dc4-adfa-3a38-899e-37a0361782bf", "vendor": {"name": "apitable"}}], "isExploited": false}